  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TCPF: Strengthening value chains and enhancing market linkages for high-value mountain products</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To enhance the livelihoods of mountain communities by leveraging their natural advantages and overcoming financial and market access barriers through the development of value chains for two of the most promising high-value mountain products, establishing effective market linkages to connect producers with buyers, ensuring products reach markets efficiently, fetch fair prices, and implementing a payback mechanism and benefit-sharing among local producers through their farmers&apos; institutions</narrative>
  </description>
